# Skill Runtime
- Keep Skill Runtime independent from specific UI components and business domains.
- Use explicit contracts, lifecycle and adapters.
- Avoid hidden global state.
- Runtime creation/disposal must be deterministic.
- Support cancellation, error propagation and observable status where applicable.
- Component internals must not leak into Skill public contracts.
- Integrations depend on public runtime interfaces, not internal files.
